          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "故事以英文撰写。如果此设备可以翻译成%@，就会显示译文，也可以随时切回原文。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stories people tell that aren't proven, or are known to be untrue. They're always labeled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人们流传的故事，未经证实或已知不实。它们都有标注。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stories updated": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "故事更新于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Story": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "故事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Street": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "街道"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Streets, alleys, corners, and roundabouts": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "街道、小巷、街角与环岛"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Structural engineer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结构工程师"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Style": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "风格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taken in %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "摄于 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a pin to see a place and what's surprising about it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点图钉，查看地点和它的意外之处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap one to see only those stories, then tap more to add them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点一项只看这类故事，再点其他项可以添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us more (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "补充说明（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks. We'll take a look.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "谢谢，我们会去核实。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's everything": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "就这些了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's the most reports for one day. Please try again tomorrow.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天的报告次数已达上限，请明天再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The feed brings you one place at a time, from everywhere Psst knows.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐每次为你带来一个地点，来自 Psst 知道的所有地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pin is in the wrong place": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图钉位置不对"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The places bundled with the app could not be found.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到 App 自带的地点数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The places could not be read (%@).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取地点数据（%@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The stories behind the places people walk past. Every place here has at least one thing about it worth leaning over to tell a friend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人们每天路过的地方背后的故事。这里的每个地点，都至少有一件事值得你凑过去告诉朋友。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Things people walk past": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "人们路过的东西"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thread: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线索：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Threads": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "线索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translate stories automatically": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动翻译故事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translated from English": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "译自英文"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Translates into %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译成%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transport": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "交通"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try a street, a station, a person, or a word from a story.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "试试街道、车站、人物，或故事里的一个词。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again. If it keeps happening, reinstalling Psst will fix it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重试。如果一直出现，重新安装 Psst 即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try another area, or look everywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "换个区域，或查看所有地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn it on in Settings to see the places around you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在“设置”中打开，即可查看你周围的地点。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Visiting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "参观信息"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Walk here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "步行前往"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Water": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水域"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What used to be here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里曾经是什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's inside": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "包含内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's the problem?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有什么问题？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a place surprises you, tap Save and it will wait for you here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "遇到让你惊喜的地方，轻点“收藏”，它就会在这里等你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you look at a city-sized part of the map with no stories yet, Psst sends which area it was (a hexagon of about 250 km²) and nothing else, so we know where to research next. It never sends where you are. Your saved places, history, and location stay on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当你查看地图上还没有故事的城市大小区域时，Psst 只会发送是哪个区域（约 250 平方公里的六边形），不发送其他任何信息，好让我们知道下一步去哪里调研。它绝不会发送你所在的位置。你的收藏、浏览记录和位置都只保存在此设备上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where names came from": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "名字从何而来"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where reliable sources disagree. The full story explains how.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可靠来源说法不一的地方。完整故事会说明分歧所在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who lived or worked here": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "谁曾在这里生活或工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've already reported this story. Thanks, we have it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已经报告过这个故事了。谢谢，我们已收到。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've been through all %lld places in %@. More are on the way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你已经看完了%2$@的全部 %1$lld 个地点。更多内容即将到来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zooms in to show them": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放大以显示它们"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· %@"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
